	(descr "32 Gbit SD NAND land, LGA-8 8.0 x 6.2 mm, 1.27 mm pitch. Fits Zetta ZDSD32GLGEAG and CS CSNP32GCR01-AOW (LCSC C2841139, the in-stock part). Pin order is the vendor top view, not a microSD socket: 1 DAT2, 2 DAT3, 3 CLK, 4 VSS, 5 CMD, 6 DAT0, 7 DAT1, 8 VDD. Land pads are 0.70 x 0.95. Pin 1 is top-left, body 6.2 mm in X and 8.0 mm in Y.")
